{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>The clods of the valley</b> — in the language of Ishmael, the place of the excavations of the valley, and it is close, on account of \"and the clods stick together.\"" "<b>And after him every man draws</b> — that they die after him, and there is no number to the dead who preceded him."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:20.537175628Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}